WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.468
Ukrainian official says

00:00:01.468 --> 00:00:03.069
200 Russian soldiers

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:05.105
were killed in a huge strike

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:06.473
by the Ukrainians

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:09.275
on a Russian base in Tok Mac, Ukraine,

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.344
and currently occupied by the Russians.

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:13.613
CNN cannot confirm the Ukrainian claims,

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:15.315
but a pro-Russian outlet

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:16.783
reported, quote, massive,

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:18.351
unquote shelling in that area,

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:19.652
which is a critical hub

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:20.553
for Russian forces.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:21.921
Meanwhile, CNN's

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.023
Alex Marquardt brings us

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:23.923
an exclusive interview

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:25.191
now with one of Ukraine's

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.961
top generals who tells CNN exactly how

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:30.563
the Ukrainians hope to deploy the newest

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.065
big U.S.

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.266
delivery

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:34.834
general.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.470
Brigadier General Alexander

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.972
Darnovsky is in charge

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:39.873
of what is arguably

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.174
the most important part

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.143
of Ukraine's counter-offensive,

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:44.377
trying to punch through

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.412
the Russian defenses

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:47.280
in southern Ukraine and split

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.115
Russia's forces

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:52.252
shows blue of the killing.

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:54.421
Now, he told CNN exclusively

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.689
he has a powerful new weapon,

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:58.591
American cluster munitions.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.293
Have you use them already?

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.461
And how much do you think

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:03.396
they're going to change the fight

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.131
in Tripoli?

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.132
We just got them.

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:08.401
We haven't used them yet, he says.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.036
But they can radically change

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:10.970
the battlefield.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.605
The enemy also understands

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:14.340
that with getting this ammunition,

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.875
we will have an advantage

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:16.276
very much

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:19.079
as the radical changes are needed.

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:19.779
As Ukraine's

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:21.047
counteroffensive has made

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:23.183
only modest gains in his area

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.151
riddled with mines.

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:25.752
The Russians,

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:28.555
he said, prepared intensely with

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:30.990
the counteroffensive is successful,

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.792
but not as much as each of us would like,

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:33.793
he tells us.

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:36.496
They made very dense, complex minefields,

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:38.631
which are now located in the areas

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:39.866
where Ukrainian equipment

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:42.168
and personnel will go through,

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.203
turn off ski hopes.

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:45.004
The Russians will abandon areas

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.107
where clusters would be most effective.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.342
He says the munitions will be strictly

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:51.144
used away from civilians

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:52.512
and only with the approval

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:54.414
of senior leadership.

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:55.982
They've arrived as artillery

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:57.584
ammunition is running low.

00:01:57.584 --> 00:01:59.586
And as news comes at a Ukrainian

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:00.553
missile strike,

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:02.789
reportedly with a British cruise missile

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.724
killed a Russian rising star.

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:06.759
Lieutenant General Oleg Sokolov,

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:07.861
the most senior Russian

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:09.562
killed in Ukraine so far,

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:12.599
Long range ammunition that can reach

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:14.567
well beyond the front line, Darnovsky

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.636
says, is in dire need.

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:17.871
If extremists would be prepared

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:18.571
to take long

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.240
range ammunition is effective.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:20.907
He says

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:21.641
this may be the most

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:23.776
problematic issue today.

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:25.512
It's like boxing, he adds.

00:02:25.512 --> 00:02:27.847
We hold the opponent at arms length

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:29.215
at long distances.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:32.152
We defeat them effectively.

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:34.888
And, Jake,

00:02:34.888 --> 00:02:36.289
the Pentagon has just confirmed

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:36.990
that these U.S.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:37.957
made cluster munitions

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:39.292
are now in Ukraine.

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:40.927
Now, these types of cluster munitions

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:43.229
are banned by more than 100 countries.

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:43.763
Those countries

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:46.166
do not include Russia, Ukraine

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:47.934
or the United States.

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.536
Now, Russia has warned

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:50.970
that if Ukraine does use

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.071
these U.s.-made clusters,

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:53.206
that they will be forced

00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:55.141
to respond in a reciprocal manner,

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:55.909
they say.

00:02:55.909 --> 00:02:57.977
But, Jake, as Wolf was just noting,

00:02:57.977 --> 00:02:59.112
the Russians have been using

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:00.380
their own cluster munitions

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.881
since the very beginning of this war.

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:03.283
And not just on the battlefield,

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:05.552
but against civilians as well Jake.

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:07.754
Alex Marquardt in the Dnipro, Ukraine,

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:08.454
thank you so much.

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:09.556
Retired four star U.S.

00:03:09.556 --> 00:03:10.490
Army general and former

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.492
CIA director David Petraeus joins us now.

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:13.826
He is the chairman of KKR

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:14.594
Global Institute,

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:15.061
which owns

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:16.829
defense contracting firms, though

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:18.198
Petraeus has not worked directly

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:18.731
with those firms.

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:20.833
General, as we heard in Alex's reporting,

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:22.335
the Ukrainian general thinks

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:24.771
that even just the threat

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:26.906
of these American cluster bombs

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:29.008
could lead to Russian troops

00:03:29.008 --> 00:03:31.444
abandoning their positions.

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:32.879
Do you think that's realistic?

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:35.915
And do you support Biden's decision to

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:37.083
send cluster bombs

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:41.788
I strongly support the decision, Jake.

00:03:41.788 --> 00:03:44.457
And I do believe that the employment

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.292
of these weapons

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:48.461
will have a significant effect.

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:49.562
There is a need

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:51.898
for this kind of munition to

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:52.966
help the Ukrainians

00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:53.766
to break through

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:56.202
these belts of minefields, tank

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:57.303
ditches, trench

00:03:57.303 --> 00:03:59.672
lines, dragons skis and so forth.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.642
They're doing that very painstakingly

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:03.710
right now.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.277
And, in fact,

00:04:04.277 --> 00:04:06.012
they're carrying out a strategy

00:04:06.012 --> 00:04:07.480
that might be described.

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:07.981
In fact,

00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:09.415
the UK chief of defense staff

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:11.251
described it as a storm

00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:12.952
stretching strike.

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:14.520
So they're specifically going

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.556
after key locations like that

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.992
strike that was in announced,

00:04:18.992 --> 00:04:19.826
not verified,

00:04:19.826 --> 00:04:22.228
but announced against a Reserve Forces

00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:23.296
Assembly area,

00:04:23.296 --> 00:04:24.430
headquarters,

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.033
ammo supply points, fuel depots

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:28.835
and artillery pieces,

00:04:28.835 --> 00:04:29.769
because the artillery

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:30.870
is the big key killer

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.372
on this battlefield.

00:04:32.372 --> 00:04:33.506
And that's the challenge

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:36.109
as they're trying to painstakingly

00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:38.311
clear leads through these minefields.

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:40.413
So this addition will be very important.

00:04:40.747 --> 00:04:41.714
It's also important

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:43.883
because these supplies of artillery

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:46.753
and rockets are starting to run low.

00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:48.554
The consumption rate is astonish

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:50.690
And we're still ramping

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:51.257
up, along

00:04:51.257 --> 00:04:52.558
with other NATO countries,

00:04:52.558 --> 00:04:54.961
our production of 155 millimeter Howitzer

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:56.696
ammunition in particular.

00:04:56.696 --> 00:04:58.965
So this is an important contribution

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:00.833
And again, one that I strongly support.

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:01.334
And by the way,

00:05:01.334 --> 00:05:03.102
the areas are already heavily done

00:05:03.102 --> 00:05:04.937
and they will have to be cleared.

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:06.306
The Russian cluster bombs

00:05:06.306 --> 00:05:07.874
have a much higher failure rate,

00:05:07.874 --> 00:05:08.708
dud rate.

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:09.042
Their

00:05:09.042 --> 00:05:12.045
this rate is considerably lower, 2.5

00:05:12.045 --> 00:05:14.580
and below percent.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.382
And so keep in mind as well

00:05:16.382 --> 00:05:17.650
that this is Ukrainians

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.018
deciding to use

00:05:19.018 --> 00:05:20.720
these munitions on their soil,

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:22.322
not someone else's soil,

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:23.022
in the process

00:05:23.022 --> 00:05:24.691
of liberating their territory.

00:05:24.691 --> 00:05:26.192
Put on your CIA director,

00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:27.660
Cap, for a moment.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:28.561
What do you think

00:05:28.561 --> 00:05:30.730
went through Putin's mind today

00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:32.598
when President Biden declared

00:05:32.598 --> 00:05:34.567
that Putin has already lost the war

00:05:36.969 --> 00:05:37.937
Well, Putin, of course, is

00:05:37.937 --> 00:05:39.572
still in denial.

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:41.341
He doesn't look in the mirror and yet

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:42.308
and see a leader

00:05:42.308 --> 00:05:43.710
who made a catastrophically

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.178
bad decision for his country

00:05:45.178 --> 00:05:47.080
that he set out to make Russia

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:47.714
great again

00:05:47.714 --> 00:05:49.382
and really has made Naito great again.

00:05:49.382 --> 00:05:49.982
And of course, now

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:50.316
we're going

00:05:50.316 --> 00:05:52.652
to see another member of NATO's

00:05:52.652 --> 00:05:53.586
join adding

00:05:53.586 --> 00:05:55.321
Sweden to Finland, already

00:05:55.321 --> 00:05:56.656
having joined as a result

00:05:56.656 --> 00:05:58.324
of this Russian invasion.

00:05:58.324 --> 00:05:59.325
And he doesn't yet

00:05:59.325 --> 00:06:01.361
acknowledge that Russia will not be able

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:02.729
to suffer.

00:06:02.729 --> 00:06:04.263
The Ukrainians, the Europeans

00:06:04.263 --> 00:06:05.031
and the Americans.

00:06:05.031 --> 00:06:06.466
But that has to be

00:06:06.466 --> 00:06:08.301
creeping into his mind.

00:06:08.301 --> 00:06:10.403
The casualties have been enormous

00:06:10.403 --> 00:06:11.938
many, many times.

00:06:11.938 --> 00:06:12.572
The losses

00:06:12.572 --> 00:06:14.407
just in the first year and a half

00:06:14.407 --> 00:06:15.842
that they took in a decade

00:06:15.842 --> 00:06:16.642
in Afghanistan,

00:06:16.642 --> 00:06:18.778
which was, of course, unsustainable.

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:20.346
And now the bite on the economy

00:06:20.346 --> 00:06:21.948
is really starting as well.

00:06:21.948 --> 00:06:23.583
I'm sure you've seen

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:24.550
that their current account

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:28.020
surplus is down by 93% over this year

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:29.389
last time.

00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:30.790
So he's got problems at home

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:31.958
and then he has problems

00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:34.627
with his mutinous Volga group commander.

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:37.764
The loss of a very senior officer,

00:06:37.764 --> 00:06:38.731
the most senior

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:40.733
so far that you announced earlier.

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:42.935
And of course, the firing of one of his

00:06:42.935 --> 00:06:45.338
most popular front line commanders.

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:46.339
Maj General Pop

00:06:46.339 --> 00:06:47.707
often commanded a little bit

00:06:47.707 --> 00:06:51.144
less than 30,000 Russians who played

00:06:51.144 --> 00:06:52.378
well with the troops, who's

00:06:52.378 --> 00:06:54.680
a very charismatic figure and real flare.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.716
He is callsign with Spartacus.

00:06:56.716 --> 00:06:58.518
He calls his soldiers gladiators.

00:06:58.518 --> 00:07:00.019
And he was complaining

00:07:00.019 --> 00:07:01.220
to his higher headquarters

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.222
about the inadequacies of their provision

00:07:03.222 --> 00:07:05.291
and support for him, in particular

00:07:05.291 --> 00:07:07.193
with the lack of firefighting radars

00:07:07.193 --> 00:07:07.660
that are now

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:08.227
enable them

00:07:08.227 --> 00:07:09.462
to conduct accurate counter

00:07:09.462 --> 00:07:11.631
fire against the Ukrainians

00:07:11.631 --> 00:07:13.399
in a number of other issues

00:07:13.399 --> 00:07:14.700
that he raised to them.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.102
And so they fired him.

00:07:16.102 --> 00:07:17.837
These are not heartening

00:07:17.837 --> 00:07:18.371
signs

00:07:18.371 --> 00:07:20.440
if you are overseeing this operation

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:21.841
from the Kremlin.

00:07:21.841 --> 00:07:23.976
Retired four star General David Petraeus.

00:07:23.976 --> 00:07:25.445
Good to see you, sir. Thanks so much.

